  :adr/body "## Summary

Formalize cloud-itonami-isic-8291 (Dossier-LLM ⊣ DisclosureGovernor) as a canonical Advisor⊣Governor actor with RAD identity, CACAO self-mint, and automated LEI discovery pipeline.

## Design

### Part A: Actor Identity
- RAD identity journal: `80-data/kotoba-rad/cloud-itonami-isic-8291.identity.journal.edn`
- CACAO self-mint: Ed25519 did:key + IPNS, portable `.cljc`, `load-or-create-identity!` persists to `.dossier/identity.edn` (gitignored)
- Tests: `test/dossier/identity_test.clj`, `test/dossier/operation_test.clj`

### Part B: `:disclosure/discover-candidates` Operation
- Advisor proposal: top-N companies + rationale + citations
- Governor: 6-stage pipeline (source-basis HARD gate reused from ADR-2607110400)
- Fallback: deterministic API clients (per ADR-2607150100, NOT governor-gated)

### Part C: LEI Discovery Automation
- `bin/collect.cljs` (nbb): read `90-docs/adr/2607110300-*.progress.edn`, call isic-8291, invoke GLEIF API, scaffold `cloud-itonami-lei-<LEI>` repos
- Honest failures logged to `retry-js-rendered.edn` (no browser JS capability in-script)

## Related ADRs
ADR-2607110400, ADR-2607150100, ADR-2607110300, ADR-2605192200"
